BT /Courier 6.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 588.49 Tm (1:  Compute dorso-ventral magnitude: s_raw[n] = az[n] - mean\(az\)   // sternal normal axis) Tj ET
BT /Courier 6.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 580.99 Tm (2:  Check physiological energy gate: if var\(s_raw\) < 0.005 or var\(s_raw\) > 0.50 then prompt stillness) Tj ET
BT /Courier 6.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 573.49 Tm (3:  Apply zero-phase 4th-order Butterworth bandpass [0.5 Hz, 40.0 Hz]: s_filt = filtfilt\(b, a, s_raw\)) Tj ET
