BT /Courier 6.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 48.00 558.49 Tm (5:  Initialize dynamic adaptive threshold: gamma[0] = mu_E[0] + 0.60 * sigma_E[0]) Tj ET
